                <mxCell id="insight-content" value="&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center;padding:10px;font-size:13px&#39;&gt;The &lt;b&gt;Engine&lt;/b&gt; only cares about standard fields:&lt;br&gt;CLNT_NO, GROUP, COHORT, SUCCESS_FLAG, DAYS_TO_SUCCESS&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;It doesn&#39;t care WHERE the data comes from.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
